    semantics (Dokan), mount management, CIFS/SMB re-sharing, and coarse per-object locking.
    Shared build settings come from the root Directory.Build.props.

    NuGet packages (DokanNet, Blobject.AmazonS3, Padlock, SyslogLogging, PrettyId) are pinned
    during the Phase 1 spike once their exact versions and APIs are verified (see
    S3DRIVE_PLAN.md sections 3.1 and 13).
  -->


